# agentik-r1 §6.1, §6.3 (packet ruling 12): `renamed` is allowed where the old name is load-
# bearing until r2: the alias and its note (Makefile), the fallbacks to the
# old state, repo and user folders, section key, plugin IDs, checkout folders and local lane
